e><issue>23</issue><fpage>2816</fpage><lpage>2821</lpage></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Kastrati A, Mehilli J, Dirschinger J, et al. (2001) Intracoronary stenting and angiographic results: strut thickness effect on restenosis outcome (ISAR-STEREO) trial. Circulation 103(23):2816&#x02013;2821 <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11401938</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR9"><label>9.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Palmaz</surname><given-names>JC</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Intravascular stents: tissue-stent interactions and design considerations</article-title><source>AJR</source><year>1993</year><volume>160</volume><issue>3</issue><fpage>613</fpage><lpage>618</lpage></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Palmaz JC (1993) Intravascular stents: tissue-stent interactions and design considerations. AJR 160(3):613&#x02013;618 <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8430566</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR10"><label>10.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Simon</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Palmaz</surname><given-names>JC</given-names></name><name><surname>Sprague</surname><given-names>EA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Influence of topography on endothelialization of stents: clues for new designs</article-title><source>J Long-Term Eff Med Implants</source><year>2000</year><volume>10</volume><issue>1&#x02013;2</issue><fpage>143</fpage><lpage>151</lpage></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Simon C, Palmaz JC, Sprague EA (2000) Influence of topography on endothelialization of stents: clues for new designs. J Long-Term Eff Med Implants 10(1&#x02013;2):143&#x02013;151 <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10947627</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR11"><label>11.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author">